common algorithms.

2. Permission. You may view, download, copy to your device, run locally,
and modify locally solely for your own personal study, free of charge
and nonexclusively. Included images may be copied as needed to run that
local copy. Retain this notice with copies.

3. Excluded uses. This permission does not include other redistribution,
sale, publication or rehosting on another website, publication of modified
versions, incorporation into other products, or independent reuse of logos
or other included images. Obtain prior written permission (email is
acceptable) for these uses. This is not an open-source license such as MIT.

4. Independent rights. This notice does not restrict rights available under
applicable law or GitHub's Terms of Service and functionality, including
applicable viewing and forking rights. It does not override independently
authorized uses or grant any third-party rights.

5. Hosted service and user images. The operator's hosted conversion tool
is free for personal and business use. Service use is distinct from reuse
of the project. The operator acquires no ownership or copyright in your
original images or conversion results. Use of the tool alone creates no
attribution or source-disclosure requirement for results. Existing rights
and conditions in original images remain applicable.

6. AI and branding. Generative AI was used during development; the logo,
favicons, and OGP image were generated with ImageGen. Copyrightability or
exclusive rights in AI output are not guaranteed. No third-party trademark,
patent, or image rights, official status, or affiliation are granted or
implied.

7. Warranty and mandatory rights. Fitness for particular purposes and
uninterrupted operation are not guaranteed. This does not exclude statutory
liability, liability for intent or gross negligence, or any mandatory rights
that cannot lawfully be limited. See terms.html and privacy.html.

8. Versions and language. This notice applies to versions distributed with
it and does not rewrite previous tags or notices. This English translation
is for convenience; the Japanese text is primary, subject to mandatory law.
